ank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10007","armor":"WP1013905","helmet":"WP1025205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10702","name":{"zh":"夷陵之战","en":"Battle of Yiling"},"year":"221","month":"5"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1067","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,74,57,52,64,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10007","armor":"WP1013905","helmet":"WP1025205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10115","name":{"zh":"征讨南蛮","en":"Southern Campaign"},"year":"225","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1067","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,74,57,52,64,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10007","armor":"WP1013905","helmet":"WP1025205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1067","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,74,57,52,64,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10007","armor":"WP1013905","helmet":"WP1025205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1067","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,74,57,52,64,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10007","armor":"WP1013905","helmet":"WP1025205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1067","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,74,57,52,64,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10007","armor":"WP1013905","helmet":"WP1025205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1067","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,74,57,52,64,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10007","armor":"WP1013905","helmet":"WP1025205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1067","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[72,74,57,52,64,78],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10007","armor":"WP1013905","helmet":"WP1025205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ1010002","city":"CS1067","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[72,74,57,52,64,78],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10007","armor":"WP1013905","helmet":"WP1025205","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"高句丽第八任君王，新大王，名伯固、伯句。其兄次大王被明临答夫杀后，被拥立为新的高句丽君主。在位期间，曾击败东汉玄菟郡的军队。抢掠新安、居乡，同时又进攻西安平，在路上杀死带方县令，抢走乐浪太守的妻子儿女。汉灵帝建宁二年，玄菟太守耿临出兵讨伐高句丽，斩杀数百人。伯固投降，其地归属东汉辽东郡。熹平年间，伯固乞求归附玄菟郡。公孙度称雄海东时，伯固派遣大加优居，主簿然人等协助公孙度击打富山叛贼，大获全胜。死后，其子男武继位，即故国川王。","tc":"高句麗第八任君王，新大王，名伯固、伯句。其兄次大王被明臨答夫殺后，被擁立為新的高句麗君主。在位期間，曾擊敗東漢玄菟郡的軍隊。搶掠新安、居鄉，同時又進攻西安平，在路上殺死帶方縣令，搶走樂浪太守的妻子兒女。漢靈帝建寧二年，玄菟太守耿臨出兵討伐高句麗，斬殺數百人。伯固投降，其地歸屬東漢遼東郡。熹平年間，伯固乞求歸附玄菟郡。公孫度稱雄海東時，伯固派遣大加優居，主簿然人等協助公孫度擊打富山叛賊，大獲全勝。死后，其子男武繼位，即故國川王。","en":"The eighth ruler of Goguryeo, King Sindae, named Bogu or Boju. After his elder brother King Chadae was slain by Myeongnim Dap-bu, he was installed as the new ruler of Goguryeo. During his reign, he defeated the armies of Eastern Han's Xuantu Commandery. He plundered Xinan and Juxiang, and also attacked Xi'anping, killing the Magistrate of Daifang along the way and seizing the wife and children of the Governor of Lelang. In the 2nd year of Jianning during the reign of Emperor Ling of Han, Geng Lin, Governor of Xuantu, led troops to subjugate Goguryeo, slaying hundreds of men. Bogu surrendered, and his lands were subordinated to Eastern Han's Liaodong Commandery. During the Xiping era, Bogu petitioned to submit to Xuantu Commandery. When Gongsun Du held sway east of the sea, Bogu dispatched the Dajia Youju, Senior Officer Ranren, and others to assist Gongsun Du in attacking the Mount Fu rebels, achieving complete victory. Following his death, his son Nammu succeeded him as King Gogukcheon.","jp":"高句麗第8代の王・新大王。名は伯固、あるいは伯句。兄の次大王が明臨答夫に殺害された後、新たな高句麗の君主として擁立された。在位中、後漢の玄菟郡の軍を撃破したことがある。新安や居郷を略奪し、さらに西安平を攻め、道中で帯方県令を殺害して楽浪太守の妻子を掠奪した。後漢の霊帝の建寧2年、玄菟太守の耿臨が高句麗討伐に出兵して数百人を討ち取ると、伯固は降伏し、その地は後漢の遼東郡に属することとなった。熹平年間、伯固は玄菟郡への帰附を請願した。公孫度が海東で覇を唱えると、伯固は大加の優居や主簿の然人らを派遣して公孫度による富山の賊討伐を支援し、大勝を収めた。死後、子の男武（故国川王）が王位を継いだ。","kr":"고구려 제8대 군주인 신대왕으로, 이름은 백고(伯固) 혹은 백구(伯句)이다. 형인 차대왕이 명림답부에게 시해된 후 새로운 고구려 군주로 옹립되었다. 재위 기간에 후한 현도군의 군대를 격파하기도 했다. 신안과 거향을 약탈하고 서안평을 공격하였으며, 도중에 대방현령을 죽이고 낙랑태수의 처자를 노략질했다. 한 영제 건녕 2년, 현도태수 경림이 군사를 내어 고구려를 토벌하고 수백 명을 참수하자 백고는 항복하였고, 그 땅은 후한 요동군에 귀속되었다. 희평 연간에 백고가 현도군에 다시 귀속되기를 청원했다. 공손도가 해동에 웅거하자, 백고는 대가 우거와 주부 연인 등을 파견해 공손도를 도와 부산의 반적을 격파하여 대승을 거두었다. 사후 아들 남무가 즉위하니, 곧 고국천왕이다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1053015","remark":"统帅","surname":"高","surnameTc":"高","surnameEn":"Gao","surnameJp":"高","surnameKr":"고","surnameOther":"","name":"伯固","nameTc":"伯固","nameEn":"Bogu","nameJp":"伯固","nameKr":"백고","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"高伯固","power":"WJ1010002","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"179","city":"CS1067","gender":"0","rule":"72","force":"74","wise":"57","politics":"52","charm":"64","will":"78","ruleTalent":"9"